---
// src/components/Experience.astro
---
<section id="experience">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Experience</span>
      <h2>Where the reps came from</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="xp">
      <div class="xp-item reveal">
        <div class="xp-when">Current</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Software Product Engineer</h3>
          <div class="org">Ogera Ventures Pvt. Ltd.</div>
          <p>Building the business's in-house product suite — a sales management system (CRM), an AI chatbot for customer communication, and other internal products — owning each from business need to production.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="xp-item reveal">
        <div class="xp-when">Previously</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Software Engineer</h3>
          <div class="org">Novox Edtech &amp; Novox Core · Calicut</div>
          <p>Built edtech products and core platform services at a startup — owning features from product conversation to production deploy across FastAPI, React, and Flutter.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="xp-item reveal">
        <div class="xp-when">Freelance</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Freelance Software Engineer</h3>
          <div class="org">Smart Akshaya · independent client work</div>
          <p>Scoped, built, and delivered an in-house operations system for an Akshaya e-governance centre — owning the full client relationship from requirements to a system the business runs on daily.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="xp-item reveal">
        <div class="xp-when">Independent</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Civic-tech builder</h3>
          <div class="org">Kerala Election Comparison System</div>
          <p>Designed and shipped a full-stack platform making every Kerala assembly election — from the first to the latest — comparable and explorable, across a dedicated backend API and React frontend.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="xp-item reveal">
        <div class="xp-when">Ongoing</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Open source &amp; community</h3>
          <div class="org">Care (ohcnetwork) · Kerala Top 100 Coders · GDG events</div>
          <p>Contributing to digital public goods in healthcare, participating in Kerala's Top 100 Coders challenge, and staying active in the Google Developer Group community.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
